 more conveniently observed in the frequency representation, compared with the raw pixel values in the spatial domain. Motivated by the intriguing properties of the Fourier domain, we propose a novel mask-frequency recipe and conduct the first study w.r.t. masked information modeling in the frequency domain for image data."
